\title{Independent evaluation and potential}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{notes}
\tag{evaluation}

\p{A training protocol can optimize its own reward without improving the
capability of interest. This section therefore defines an independent
evaluation before defining post-training gain. It then introduces the costed
potential construction as an FTIP proposal.}

